{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>你是否厭倦了傳統試算表或枯燥的記帳 App？《BudgetGoal》專為希望圍繞個人目標進行預算管理的用戶而設計，提供更直觀的視覺化方式來掌握兩次發薪日之間的財務狀況。目前這款工具正推出終生版限時免費，讓你不需花費即可解鎖完整功能。</p>\n\n<h2>三大核心功能介紹</h2>\n<p>這款 App 讓你能夠設定儲蓄目標、追蹤開支，並在消費前即時查看該筆支出對進度的影響。透過智能支出影響檢查、視覺化目標進度條、每日預算指引以及互動 widget，協助你在日常花費與長期目標之間取得平衡，做出更有信心的財務決策。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1284x2778bb-115-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1284x2778bb-116-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1284x2778bb-117-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1284x2778bb-118-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1284x2778bb-119-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1284x2778bb-120-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<h2>限時免費領取終生版</h2>\n<p>BudgetGoal 終生版內購限時免費中，用戶完成初始化後看到收費牆，Lifetime 價格顯示為$0 即可免費收下。注意，如果看到價格不是 $0 代表限免已完結，請勿按付費確認。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：BudgetGoal</li>\n<li>應用類別：Finance</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-22T23:38:23.371580+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":385,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"unknown"}}